-- 原生体合成来源说明
L["Available at the Synthesis Forge after unlocking pet Protoform Synthesis through Dealic Understanding and the Protoform Synthesis quest."] = "在通过「德利尔理解」与原生体合成任务解锁宠物原生体合成后，可在合成熔炉制作。"
L["Underwater by Ancient Hopper on the Sepulcher island. Chapter 4 campaign access is required."] = "在圣墓岛的远古漏斗旁的水下，需要完成战役第四章才能进入。"
L["Under the top platform with the Malfunctioned Constructor in the Plains of Actualization."] = "在践行平原上，失灵构造体所在的高台下方。"
L["Atop a floating tree in the Untamed Verdure; requires flying or a displacement ability."] = "在蛮荒绿地的悬浮树顶，需要飞行或位移能力。"
L["Hidden beneath foliage on a floating tree in the Path of Inception."] = "在起始之路的悬浮树上，藏在树叶之下。"
L["Inside the Mistaken Ovoid treasure; if previously looted, find it behind the Frazzled Poultrid Hen."] = "在「错误的卵」宝藏中；若已拾取过，可在憔悴的家禽母鸡后方找到。"
L["In Rondure Alcove after Altonian Understanding and A Means to an End; use the jumping puzzle or a displacement ability."] = "在获得「阿尔顿理解」与「终结之道」后前往环形壁龛，需完成跳跳谜题或使用位移能力。"
L["On a chain over the Dimensional Falls. Begin above it in the Untamed Verdure, then carefully jump down."] = "在次元瀑布上方的锁链上。从蛮荒绿地的高处开始，小心跳下。"
L["Chance to be looted from Crystallized Echo of the First Song."] = "有几率从「初歌的结晶回响」中开出。"
L["At the back of a shelf in the Lexical Grotto; use a displacement ability from the marked entrance."] = "在词汇洞窟的架子深处，从标记入口使用位移能力抵达。"
L["Can drop from Lihuvim in the Sepulcher of the First Ones raid."] = "可由初诞者圣墓团队副本的利许威姆掉落。"
L["Inside a torch-like structure in the Arrangement Index; fly, use a displacement ability, or glide from the Repository."] = "在编队索引的火炬状建筑内，可飞行、使用位移能力或从宝库滑翔抵达。"
L["Inside Locrian Esper: enter the first room, turn right twice, then look beneath the pile between rooms."] = "在洛克里安感知器内部：进入第一个房间后连续右转两次，查看两房之间堆积物下方。"
L["Chance reward from completing the Cluck, Cluck, Boom daily quest."] = "完成「咯咯咯，砰」日常任务后有几率获得。"
L["Inside the Library Vault treasure; if previously looted, the schematic remains at the same spot."] = "在图书馆宝库宝藏中；若已拾取过，图纸仍留在原处。"
L["Loot the Grateful Boon treasure; if previously looted, the schematic appears at the same spot."] = "拾取「感恩之赐」宝藏；若已拾取过，图纸会出现在同一地点。"
L["Chance from Tribute of the Enlightened Elders, the Patterns Within Patterns weekly cache."] = "有几率从周常任务「模式中的模式」奖励的「启迪长者贡品」中开出。"
L["Inside Gravid Repose: take the right ramp; the schematic is in the structure at its top."] = "在孕育安息之地：走右侧坡道，图纸位于坡顶的建筑内。"
L["Chance from a Pulp-Covered Relic treasure, which can spawn in several parts of Zereth Mortis."] = "有几率从「浆糊覆盖的遗物」宝藏中开出，该宝藏会在扎雷殁提斯多处刷新。"
L["In Sepulcher of the First Ones, loot it near a pillar in Halondrus' phase-two room after defeating Halondrus."] = "在初诞者圣墓中击败哈隆杜斯后，于其二阶段房间内的柱子旁拾取。"
L["Inside a cage in the Arrangement Index; reach it from the broken pillar by flying or using a displacement ability."] = "在编队索引的笼子里，可从断裂的柱子处飞行或使用位移能力抵达。"
L["Reward from A New Architect, the quest that unlocks Protoform Synthesis for mounts. Currently only granted to the first character on the account to unlock the system."] = "解锁坐骑原生体合成的「新建筑师」任务奖励。目前仅账号中第一个解锁该系统的角色可获得。"
L["Atop a tall pillar in the Plain of Actualization; requires flying or a displacement ability."] = "在践行平原的高柱顶端，需要飞行或位移能力。"
L["Inside a ground-level vespoid hive in the Resonant Peaks."] = "在共鸣峰的地面层蜂巢内。"
L["By the Genesis Vestibule, atop the structure leading to the Genesis Alcove; climb from its left side."] = "在起源前厅旁、通往起源壁龛的建筑顶部，从左侧攀爬上去。"
L["Chance to drop from Accelerated Bufonid mobs in Zereth Mortis."] = "有几率从扎雷殁提斯的加速蟾蜍怪掉落。"
L["Chance to drop from Maw-Frenzied Lupine inside the Choral Residium cave."] = "有几率从合唱回廊洞穴内的噬渊狂乱豺狼人掉落。"
L["Speak to Shade of Irik-tu at the back of Firim's cave while dead, in ghost form."] = "死亡后以灵魂形态与菲历姆洞穴深处的伊里克图之影对话。"
L["Chance to drop from Mawsworn Hulk in the Endless Sands."] = "有几率从无尽沙海的渊誓巨兽掉落。"
L["Reward for the Cyphers of the First Ones achievement; check your mailbox after fully researching the Cypher tree."] = "完成「初诞者密文」成就的奖励；研究完密文树后请检查邮箱。"
L["Inside the Forgotten Proto-Vault; reach the mountain using flying or the Frog'it world-quest frog."] = "在遗忘的原生体宝库中，可用飞行或蛙刃世界任务的青蛙上山。"
L["Inside the Chamber of Shaping, on a bench-like structure behind the Dominated Architect."] = "在塑造之厅内，被支配的建筑师后方的长椅状结构上。"
L["Chance from Enlightened Broker Supplies, the Enlightened Paragon reputation cache."] = "有几率从启迪者商人补给（启迪者典范声望宝箱）中开出。"
L["Atop an arch on Antecedent Isle; use flying or a displacement ability to reach it."] = "在先驱之岛的拱门顶端，需飞行或位移能力抵达。"
L["In the northeast end of Vigilant Guardian's room in Sepulcher of the First Ones, hanging from the decor."] = "在初诞者圣墓警戒卫士房间的东北端，悬挂在装饰物上。"
L["Inside the Mawsworn Cache treasure; if previously looted, the schematic is at that location."] = "在渊誓宝箱宝藏内；若已拾取过，图纸仍在原处。"
L["Inside a small Arrangement Index building, immediately to the right after entering."] = "在编队索引的一座小建筑内，进门后立刻右转即可看到。"
