L["In the Resonant Peaks puzzles, on the Primus Locus level; flying or a displacement climb reaches it."] = "在共鸣峰解谜区域的原初基座层，可飞行或位移攀爬抵达。"
L["Drops from nearly every mob in Zereth Mortis. Fastest farm: the devourer portals in Genesis Fields; also from A New Architect and the weekly Patterns Within Patterns cache."] = "扎雷殁提斯几乎所有怪物都会掉落。最快的刷法是起源平原的吞噬者传送门；「新建筑师」任务与周常宝箱也会给予。"
